{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25149","headline":"终南精舍月中闻磬 · 独孤申叔","name":"终南精舍月中闻磬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"精庐残夜景，天宇灭埃氛。\n幽磬此时击，余音几处闻。\n随风树杪去，支策月中分。\n断绝如残漏，凄清不隔云。\n羇人方罢梦，独鴈忽迷羣。\n响尽河汉落，千山空纠纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤申叔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}